# ==============================================================================
# DEVELOPER PORTFOLIO - ENVIRONMENT & SERVICE CONFIGURATION
# Karthik Venkata Jaya Karthik
# ==============================================================================
#
# This portfolio is designed as a high-performance static website that can be
# hosted for free on GitHub Pages, Vercel, Netlify, or Cloudflare Pages.
#
# To configure the real contact form message delivery, you have two zero-cost options:
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Formspree (Fastest & Recommended)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up free at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form (e.g., "Karthik Portfolio Contact")
# 3. Copy your Form Endpoint URL (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/mqkenwkr)
# 4. Open `js/config.js` and set:
#      FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT: 'https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID'
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: EmailJS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up free at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Add an Email Service (Gmail / Outlook)
# 3. Create an Email Template with fields {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}
# 4. Open `js/config.js` and set:
#      EMAILJS: {
#        SERVICE_ID: 'your_service_id',
#        TEMPLATE_ID: 'your_template_id',
#        PUBLIC_KEY: 'your_public_key'
#      }
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RESUME & PROJECTS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Resume PDF is located at: `assets/resume.pdf`
# - Resume Markdown is located at: `assets/resume.md`
# - To update live demo URLs for projects, open `js/config.js` -> PROJECT_LINKS
